# Line endings: LF in every checkout, Windows included.
# A clone with Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) turned the scripts into CRLF and
# setup.sh failed in WSL with «env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory»; the
# scripts copied into the images (docker-entrypoint.sh…) broke the same way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, explicitly (no conversion, no diff).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
